<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" version="1.2" xsi:schemaLocation="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:1.2 xliff-core-1.2-transitional.xsd">
  <file datatype="xml" source-language="en" target-language="ko" original="../BrowserCommandStrings.resx">
    <body>
      <trans-unit id="CaptureScreenshotDescription">
        <source>Capture a screenshot from the active tracked browser session and save it as a PNG artifact.</source>
        <target state="translated">추적한 활성 브라우저 세션에서 스크린샷을 캡처하여 PNG 아티팩트로 저장하세요.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="CaptureScreenshotName">
        <source>Capture screenshot</source>
        <target state="translated">스크린샷 캡처</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserApplied">
        <source>Applied tracked browser settings for {0}.</source>
        <target state="translated">{0}에 대해 추적한 브라우저 설정을 적용했습니다.</target>
        <note>{0} is the resource name or scope that the settings apply to</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserBrowserDescription">
        <source>Choose an installed Chromium-based browser or enter an executable path.</source>
        <target state="translated">설치된 Chromium 기반 브라우저를 선택하거나 실행 파일 경로를 입력합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserBrowserLabel">
        <source>Browser</source>
        <target state="translated">브라우저</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserBrowserRequired">
        <source>Browser is required.</source>
        <target state="translated">브라우저가 필요합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserChromeOption">
        <source>Google Chrome (chrome)</source>
        <target state="translated">Google Chrome(chrome)</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserChromiumOption">
        <source>Chromium (chromium)</source>
        <target state="translated">Chromium(chromium)</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserDefaultProfileOption">
        <source>Browser default profile</source>
        <target state="translated">브라우저 기본 프로필</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserDescription">
        <source>Choose the browser, profile, user data mode, and scope used by tracked browser sessions.</source>
        <target state="translated">추적된 브라우저 세션에서 사용하는 브라우저, 프로필, 사용자 데이터 모드 및 scope를 선택합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserEdgeOption">
        <source>Microsoft Edge (msedge)</source>
        <target state="translated">Microsoft Edge(msedge)</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserGlobalScopeOption">
        <source>All BrowserLogs resources</source>
        <target state="translated">모든 BrowserLogs 리소스</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserGlobalScopeResult">
        <source>all BrowserLogs resources</source>
        <target state="translated">모든 BrowserLogs 리소스</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserInteractionUnavailable">
        <source>Tracked browser settings cannot be configured because dashboard interactions are not available.</source>
        <target state="translated">dashboard 상호 작용을 사용할 수 없으므로 추적된 브라우저 설정을 구성할 수 없습니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserName">
        <source>Configure tracked browser</source>
        <target state="translated">추적한 브라우저 구성</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserProfileDescription">
        <source>Choose a Chromium profile from the Aspire-managed browser hive, or enter a profile directory/name.</source>
        <target state="translated">Aspire에서 관리하는 브라우저 하이브에서 Chromium 프로필을 선택하거나 프로필 디렉터리/이름을 입력하세요.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserProfileLabel">
        <source>Profile</source>
        <target state="translated">프로필</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserProfileOptionWithDisplayName">
        <source>{0} ({1})</source>
        <target state="translated">{0}({1})</target>
        <note>{0} is the Chromium profile directory name, {1} is the Chromium profile display name</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserProfileRequiresShared">
        <source>Profiles can only be selected when user data mode is Shared.</source>
        <target state="translated">프로필은 사용자 데이터 모드가 공유된 경우에만 선택할 수 있습니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserPromptMessage">
        <source>Choose tracked browser settings. Resource-specific settings override global BrowserLogs settings.</source>
        <target state="translated">추적된 브라우저 설정을 선택합니다. 리소스별 설정은 전역 BrowserLogs 설정을 재정의합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserResourceScopeOption">
        <source>This resource only ({0})</source>
        <target state="translated">이 리소스만({0})</target>
        <note>{0} is the Aspire resource name</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserSaveButton">
        <source>Apply</source>
        <target state="translated">적용</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserSaveFailed">
        <source>Tracked browser settings could not be saved to user secrets for key '{0}'.</source>
        <target state="translated">키 '{0}'에 대해 추적된 브라우저 설정을 사용자 비밀에 저장할 수 없습니다.</target>
        <note>{0} is the user secrets configuration key</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserSaveToUserSecretsDescriptionConfigured">
        <source>Save these settings to [user secrets](https://aka.ms/aspire/user-secrets) so future AppHost runs use them.</source>
        <target state="translated">향후 AppHost 실행에서도 이러한 설정을 사용하려면 [사용자 암호](https://aka.ms/aspire/user-secrets)에 저장하세요.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserSaveToUserSecretsDescriptionNotConfigured">
        <source>User secrets are not configured for this AppHost, so settings can only apply to this running AppHost.</source>
        <target state="translated">이 AppHost에는 사용자 암호가 구성되어 있지 않으므로 설정은 실행 중인 이 AppHost에만 적용됩니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserSaveToUserSecretsLabel">
        <source>Save to AppHost user secrets</source>
        <target state="translated">AppHost 사용자 암호에 저장</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserSaved">
        <source>Saved tracked browser settings for {0}.</source>
        <target state="translated">{0}에 대해 추적한 브라우저 설정을 저장했습니다.</target>
        <note>{0} is the resource name or scope that the settings apply to</note>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserScopeLabel">
        <source>Scope</source>
        <target state="translated">범위</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserUserDataModeLabel">
        <source>User data mode</source>
        <target state="translated">사용자 데이터 모드</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserUserDataModeRequired">
        <source>User data mode must be Shared or Isolated.</source>
        <target state="translated">사용자 데이터 모드는 공유 또는 격리여야 합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="ConfigureTrackedBrowserUserSecretsUnavailable">
        <source>Tracked browser settings cannot be saved because the AppHost does not have user secrets configured.</source>
        <target state="translated">AppHost에 사용자 암호가 구성되어 있지 않아 추적한 브라우저 설정을 저장할 수 없습니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OpenTrackedBrowserDescription">
        <source>Open the app in a tracked browser session and stream browser logs to this resource.</source>
        <target state="translated">추적된 브라우저 세션에서 앱을 열고 브라우저 로그를 이 리소스로 스트리밍합니다.</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="OpenTrackedBrowserName">
        <source>Open tracked browser</source>
        <target state="translated">추적한 브라우저 열기</target>
        <note />
      </trans-unit>
    </body>
  </file>
</xliff>